  "instance_name": "anti_black_stereotype_pet",
  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Black people as property or pets",
  "description": "This stereotype reduces Black individuals to objects of possession or property, implying they are not human beings with inherent dignity but rather commodities to be owned or controlled. The meme explicitly uses the phrase 'new pet' to dehumanize the Black child, framing their presence as something to be owned or enjoyed by the white child, which is a direct and dehumanizing racist trope.",
